{"id":"1198a516f2c400b1","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-formalized-lob.md","title":"Formalized Löb Principle","display":"thm-formalized-lob — Formalized Löb Principle","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-formalized-lob","aliases":["67-thm-formalized-lob"],"display":"thm-formalized-lob — Formalized Löb Principle","depends_on":["[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-provability-conditions]]","[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","[[67-df-sentence]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":2,"source_label":"equation L following Theorem 6","source_printed_pages":"29","source_pdf_pages":"40","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"来源陈述与证明已读；上列有限BL推导已人工复核，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-formalized-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-formalized-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-formalized-lob — Formalized Löb Principle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"equation L following Theorem 6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"29"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"40"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"来源陈述与证明已读；上列有限BL推导已人工复核，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(v)\">\\(P(v)\\)</span> 是一元算术公式，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)\\)</span>；其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\psi=P(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\">\\(P_\\psi=P(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\\)</span> 使用同一自然编号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；固定点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a>。下式所有箭头内的表达式均为对象语言句法构造，外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\)</span> 为元语言可推导性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\bigl(P_{(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)}\\to P_\\varphi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\bigl(P_{(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)}\\to P_\\varphi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.29 的式 (L)；已目视核对 PDF 40 的括号范围。它是 PA 内可证明的 Löb 公式，比从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 的外部规则更强。</p>\n<p>本地推导：取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\theta\\leftrightarrow(P_\\theta\\to\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\theta\\leftrightarrow(P_\\theta\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>。BLi–iii 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_\\theta\\to P_\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_\\theta\\to P_\\varphi\\)</span>。因此 PA 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to(P_\\theta\\to\\varphi)\">\\((P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to(P_\\theta\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>，再由固定点证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\theta\">\\((P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\theta\\)</span>。对这个 PA 定理用 BLi、BLii，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_{(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)}\\to P_\\theta\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_{(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)}\\to P_\\theta\\)</span>，与第一步合成所述结论。无需外部一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$，$P(v)$ 是一元算术公式，满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)$；其 $P_\\psi=P(\\overline{g(\\psi)})$ 使用同一自然编号。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；固定点见 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。下式所有箭头内的表达式均为对象语言句法构造，外层 $\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash$ 为元语言可推导性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"P(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\psi=P(\\overline{g(\\psi)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\bigl(P_{(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)}\\to P_\\varphi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\theta\\leftrightarrow(P_\\theta\\to\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_\\theta\\to P_\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to(P_\\theta\\to\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)\\to\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_{(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi)}\\to P_\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":1898,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-formalized-lob]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-godel-first-